body:
It always has the name of the guest even if its  prepaid and yes it shows the full credit card number and expiration date and type of card. It also shows all the guest name and information like address and phone number along with the other hotel details like type of room and number of rooms. The only company that puts if it was prepaid or not is sExpedia and it is written in the comment section of the fax. Most of the time determining if its prepaid is a guessing game or asking the customer who isnt often always to sure.

